1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Guillaume I de Craon, Vicomte de Chateaudun & de la Ferte-Bernard1 
2 CONT *''''''M, b. after 15 April 1318, d. 8 June 1387
2 CONT *Father     Amaury III, Seigneur de Craon b. 1280, d. 26 Jan 1333
2 CONT *Mother     Beatrix de Roucy2 d. 7 Nov 1328
2 CONT *''''''     Guillaume I de Craon, Vicomte de Chateaudun & de la Ferte-Bernard was born after 15 April 1318.1 He married Marguerite of Flanders, daughter of Jean de Flanders Seigneur de Crevecoeur, Nesle, & d'Alleux and Beatrix de 
2 CONC Chatillon-sur-Marne, before 4 May 1341.3 Guillaume I de Craon, Vicomte de Chateaudun & de la Ferte-Bernard died on 8 June 1387; Buried at Cordeliers de Chateaudun.1
2 CONT *''''''Family      Marguerite of Flanders d. a 3 Jul 1387
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **◦Pierre de Craon, Seigneur de Brunetel, Rosoy-en-Thiérache, Suze, Sablé, & de la Ferté-Bernard+1 d. bt Jan 1407 - 14 Jan 1410
2 CONT **◦Jean I de Craon, Seigneur de Domart-en-Ponthieu, Vidame de Laonnois+4 d. bt 23 Mar 1409 - 2 Dec 1409
2 CONT **◦Sir Guillaume II de Craon, Vicomte de Chateaudun & Montbazon, Sire de Marcillac & Colombiers+1 d. bt 3 Jul 1409 - 6 Jun 1410
2 CONT **◦Beatrix de Craon+5,1 b. c 1335, d. 26 Sep 1376
2 CONT **◦Marie de Craon+5 b. c 1350, d. b 22 Dec 1401
2 CONT **◦Jeanne de Craon+5 b. c 1350
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. III, Tafel 721.
2 CONT * 2.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. III, Tafel 720.
2 CONT * 3.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. II, Tafel 8; Vol. III, Tafel 721.
2 CONT * 4.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. III, Tafels 721-722.
2 CONT * 5.[S56] Généalogie Famille de Carné.
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1877.htm#i56419
2 CONT *____________
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Guillaume I of Craon       Born:    1318     Died:    1387
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: •Amaury III of Craon (1280-1333)        Mother: •Beatrix de Roucy (Pierrepont) ( -1328) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:   to Marguerite of Dampierre ( -1387)      
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:  Maurice VII of Craon ( -1330)     **     Pierre I de Craon (bef. 1328-1376)     **     Jeanne de Craon (1315- )      
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:  Beatrice of Craon (c. 1335-1376)     **     Marie de Craon (c. 1350-1401)     **     Pierre of Craon-Sainte-Maure (1345- )     **     Jean I de Craon ( -1408)     **     Guillaume de Craon (c. 1340-aft. 1407)      
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes:  Viscount of Chateaudun. 
