2 CONT 	3  PAGE quoted in APGHS Newsletter, v. 21, no. 3 (2000), p. 60
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Genea Portugal lists Jean III's children as João de Bettencourt, rei das Canárias, Regnault de Bettencourt, and an unnamed son to whom is ascribed the children Jorge, Henri, and Maciot. There seems to be some confusion with Regnau
2 CONC lt who is the father of these sons
