1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''CATHERINE de Machecoul (-21 Jul 1410).''' 
2 CONT d/o JEAN de Machecoul & JEANNE Chabot, d/o GERARD [IV] Chabot Seigneur de Rays &  Catherine de Laval. 
2 CONT x (<8 May 1362) PIERRE de Craon Seigneur de la Suze, s/o MAURY [III] Seigneur de Craon &  Beatrix de Roucy (-19 Nov 1376, bur Angers Cordeliers).
2 CONT *JEAN de Craon (-25 Nov 1432). Seigneur de la Suze. x BEATRIX de Rochefort xx ANNE de Sillé,
2 CONT *PIERRE de Craon (-after 25 Nov 1432).
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/brittnpr.htm#JeanMachecoulCochedied1308
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/anjounob.htm#MarieCraonMGuyLaval
2 CONT ----
2 CONT JEAN de Machecoul .  He is named as the father of the three children shown below in the [1403] document quoted below.  m JEANNE Chabot, daughter of GERARD [IV] Chabot Seigneur de Rays & his wife Catherine de Laval.  Her family ori
2 CONC gin and marriage are confirmed by the following document: [her grandson] “Jean de La Suze”, in a document (dated to [1403]) claiming the superiority of his rights “à la succession de Retz” over those of “Guy de Laval seigneur de B
2 CONC laison”, explained that “Jeanne sœur de Girard Chabot III” and her husband “Jean de Machecoul” had three children “Girard et Louis morts sans enfants et Catherine”[278].  Considering her daughter’s marriage dated to “before 8 May 
2 CONC 1362”, Jeanne must have been the sister of Gérard [V] Chabot.  Jean & his wife had three children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         GERARD de Machecoul .  His parentage is confirmed by the following: [his nephew] “Jean de La Suze”, in a document (dated to [1403]) claiming the superiority of his rights “à la succession de Retz” over those of “Guy de 
2 CONC Laval seigneur de Blaison”, explained that “Jeanne sœur de Girard Chabot III” and her husband “Jean de Machecoul” had three children “Girard et Louis morts sans enfants et Catherine”[279]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         LOUIS de Machecoul .  His parentage is confirmed by the following: [his nephew] “Jean de La Suze”, in a document (dated to [1403]) claiming the superiority of his rights “à la succession de Retz” over those of “Guy de L
2 CONC aval seigneur de Blaison”, explained that “Jeanne sœur de Girard Chabot III” and her husband “Jean de Machecoul” had three children “Girard et Louis morts sans enfants et Catherine”[280]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT c)         '''CATHERINE de Machecoul (-21 Jul 1410).  A document dated 24 Feb 1387 (O.S.) records an adjournment of a claim by "Isabelle [de Craon], Guy VI et Marie de Sully" against “Catherine de Machecoul veuve de Pierre de la S
2 CONC uze tant en son nom que comme bail de Pierre son fils, et Jean de Craon chevalier son fils aîné”[281].  A judgment of the Parliament dated 20 Jul 1392 related to the claim brought by “Catherine de Machecoul” against “Louis Larchev
2 CONC êque bail de Berthelet de la Haye, Hélion Chemillé et Guy Aménart” for her share in revenue “sur Brissac, qui venait de Girard de Machecoul”[282].  An arrêt of the Parliament dated 26 Apr 1393 related to the claim brought by “Alie
2 CONC tte de Chemillé et Guy Aménart” against “Catherine de Machecoul” concerning revenue they claimed “comme héritiers de Louis et de Thomas de Chemillé”[283].  Her family origin and marriage are confirmed by the following document: a 
2 CONC judgment of the Parliament dated 29 Apr 1396 in the claim brought by “Pernelle” against “Catherine de Machecoul...Jean de La Suze chevalier et...Pierre son frère écuyer ses enfants” concerning rights over “Chanotocé et Ingrande”[2
2 CONC 84].  Her precise parentage is indicated by the following: [her son] “Jean de La Suze”, in a document (dated to [1403]) claiming the superiority of his rights “à la succession de Retz” over those of “Guy de Laval seigneur de Blais
2 CONC on”, explained that “Jeanne sœur de Girard Chabot III” and her husband “Jean de Machecoul” had three children “Girard et Louis morts sans enfants et Catherine”, the son of the last named “Jean de Craon” inheriting in place of “Guy
2 CONC  de Laval, exclu par la renonciation de Jeanne, épouse de Foulques de Laval”[285].  m (before 8 May 1362) as his second wife, PIERRE de Craon Seigneur de la Suze, son of AMAURY [III] Seigneur de Craon & his second wife Beatrix de 
2 CONC Roucy (-19 Nov 1376, bur Angers Cordeliers).''' 
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/brittnpr.htm#JeanMachecoulCochedied1308
2 CONT
2 CONT 1)         JEAN de Craon (-25 Nov 1432).  Seigneur de la Suze m firstly (contract 26 Jul 1385) BEATRIX de Rochefort, daughter of GUILLAUME de Rochefort-sur-Loire & his wife Jeanne d’Ancenis (-1421). m secondly (before 9 May 1422, 
2 CONC contract 1429) as her second husband, ANNE de Sillé, widow of JEAN de Montjean, daughter of GUILLAUME de Sillé-le-Guillaume & his wife Pernelle de Coesmes (-after 25 Jan 1434). 
2 CONT 2)         PIERRE de Craon (-after 25 Nov 1432). 
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/anjounob.htm#MarieCraonMGuyLaval
2 CONT ----
