1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Marguerite of Flanders1 
2 CONT *''''''F, d. after 3 July 1387
2 CONT *Father     Jean de Flanders Seigneur de Crevecoeur, Nesle, & d'Alleux1 d. 2 May 1325
2 CONT *Mother     Beatrix de Chatillon-sur-Marne1 d. bt 1350 - 18 Dec 1352
2 CONT *''''''     Marguerite of Flanders married Guillaume I de Craon, Vicomte de Chateaudun & de la Ferte-Bernard, son of Amaury III, Seigneur de Craon and Beatrix de Roucy, before 4 May 1341.1 Marguerite of Flanders died after 3 July 
2 CONC 1387.1
2 CONT *''''''Family      Guillaume I de Craon, Vicomte de Chateaudun & de la Ferte-Bernard b. a 15 Apr 1318, d. 8 Jun 1387
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **◦Pierre de Craon, Seigneur de Brunetel, Rosoy-en-Thiérache, Suze, Sablé, & de la Ferté-Bernard+2 d. bt Jan 1407 - 14 Jan 1410
2 CONT **◦Jean I de Craon, Seigneur de Domart-en-Ponthieu, Vidame de Laonnois+3 d. bt 23 Mar 1409 - 2 Dec 1409
2 CONT **◦Sir Guillaume II de Craon, Vicomte de Chateaudun & Montbazon, Sire de Marcillac & Colombiers+2 d. bt 3 Jul 1409 - 6 Jun 1410
2 CONT **◦Beatrix de Craon+2,4 b. c 1335, d. 26 Sep 1376
2 CONT **◦Marie de Craon+4 b. c 1350, d. b 22 Dec 1401
2 CONT **◦Jeanne de Craon+4 b. c 1350
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. II, Tafel 8; Vol. III, Tafel 721.
2 CONT * 2.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. III, Tafel 721.
2 CONT * 3.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. III, Tafels 721-722.
2 CONT * 4.[S56] Généalogie Famille de Carné.
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1877.htm#i56422
2 CONT *________________
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Marguerite of Dampierre       Died:    1387 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Jean of Flanders ( -1325)        Mother: Beatrix of Chatillon ( -1350) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:   to Guillaume I of Craon (1318-1387)      
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:  Beatrice of Craon (c. 1335-1376)     **     Marie de Craon (c. 1350-1401)     **     Pierre of Craon-Sainte-Maure (1345- )     **     Jean I de Craon ( -1408)     **     Guillaume de Craon (c. 1340-aft. 1407)      
