2 CONC iscount of Béziers, Albi and Carcassone 1209–1218	Succeeded by Amaury Preceded by Bernard Ato VI	Viscount of Nîmes 1214–1218 Preceded by Raymond VI	— DISPUTED — Count of Toulouse 1215–1218 Disputed by Raymond VI	Succeeded by Raymo
