2 CONT A discussion took place as to whether Guiberge should be retained as a daughter of Simon de Montfort and Amice de Beaumont which I suspected she shouldn't and following these comments from Justin I am disconnecting her but we wish
2 CONC  to keep the notes as a record of the doubt:
2 CONT
2 CONT Justin Swanström 17 May 2014  I've come to the end of looking, I think.
2 CONT
2 CONT I end up with two supposed daughters of Simon (d. 1181) and Amice de Beaumont I can't account for -- Guiburge and Péronelle. I'm going to keep them connected here in my own database but suggested we disconnect them on Geni.
2 CONT
2 CONT Justin Swanström 16/5/2014  Still looking. Now that The Big Discussion is over I'll have some more time.
2 CONT
2 CONT I found this site that has some of the old Theroff files:  http://www.angelfire.com/realm/gotha/
2 CONT
2 CONT And many of the others seem to have turned into the "Online Gotha". I think I already knew that, just haven't looked in so long:  http://www.angelfire.com/realm/gotha/gotha/gotha.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT This is the file that should have Guiburge, but it doesn't:  http://www.angelfire.com/realm/gotha/gotha/montfortlamaury.html
2 CONT
2 CONT He has Simon (d. 1181) married to Mahaut, and their son Simon (d. by 1188) married to Amicie de Beaumont.
2 CONT
2 CONT Without further research, I would trust this reconstruction.
2 CONT
2 CONT Now I just need to get back over to the other computer and compare that to my own data, make corrections, then go look at Geni ;)
2 CONT
2 CONT Terry Jackson Curator 18th May 2014 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
