2 CONT *'''     A contract for the marriage of William de Montmorency, Baron de Montmorency, d'Ecouen, Chantilly, & Damville and Anne Pot was signed on 17 July 1484 at Paris, France.2 William de Montmorency, Baron de Montmorency, d'Ecoue
2 CONC n, Chantilly, & Damville died on 24 May 1531; Buried at Montmorency.3,2
2 CONT *'''Family    Anne Pot d. 24 Feb 1510
