1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/L4BD-9JS/jean-de-humez-1174-1223
2 CONT
2 CONT The Life Summary of Jean When Jean de Humez was born about 1174, in Sheringham, Norfolk, England, his father, Jordon de Humez, was 38 and his mother, Hawise de Crèvecoeur, was 39. He married unknown du Hummet de Grey in 1202, in E
2 CONC ngland, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 1 daughter. He died before 1223, in Sheringham, Norfolk, England, United Kingdom, at the age of 48.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents and Siblings Jordon de Humez 1136–1192 Hawise de Crèvecoeur 1135–1174
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings
2 CONT
2 CONT John Humez 1165–1207 Jordan de Humez 1165–1207 Jean de Humez 1174–1223
