1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''JEANNE [Eléonore] de Léon'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===From Medlands:===
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BRITTANY.htm#JeanneLeonMEudesPorhoet
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert of Torigny records the marriage in 1167 of "comes Eudes" and "Guihunmanus filius Hervei vicecomes Leonensis…filiam" but does not name her[523].  m (Aug 1167) as his second wife, EUDES Vicomte de Porhoët, son of GEOFFROY Vic
2 CONC omte de Porhoët & his wife Hadvise --- (-1170).  He succeeded in 1148 as EUDES Duke of Brittany, by right of his wife, but was deposed by his stepson in 1156 and taken prisoner by Raoul de Fougères
