1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Marie de Chatillon1,2,3 
2 CONT *''''''F, d. between 7 May 1412 and 25 October 1415
2 CONT *Father     Sir Gaucher de Chatillon, Seigneur de Rozoy & Clancey, Vidame de Laonnois1,2 d. bt 23 Aug 1350 - 11 Dec 1355
2 CONT *Mother     Marie de Coucy1,2 d. a 1355
2 CONT *''''''     Marie de Chatillon married Jean I de Craon, Seigneur de Domart-en-Ponthieu, Vidame de Laonnois, son of Guillaume I de Craon, Vicomte de Chateaudun & de la Ferte-Bernard and Marguerite of Flanders, circa 5 May 1364.4,2,
2 CONC 3 Marie de Chatillon died between 7 May 1412 and 25 October 1415.2
2 CONT *''''''Family      Jean I de Craon, Seigneur de Domart-en-Ponthieu, Vidame de Laonnois d. bt 23 Mar 1409 - 2 Dec 1409
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **◦Marguerite de Craon+5
2 CONT **◦Jacqueline de Craon+6
2 CONT **◦Jean II de Craon, Seigneur de Domart, Bernaville, & Clacy, Vidame de Laonnois+7 d. c 25 Oct 1415
2 CONT **◦Jeanne de Craon7 b. c 1388, d. 26 Aug
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. VII, Tafel 19.
2 CONT * 2.[S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XXVI, Tafel 4.
2 CONT * 3.[S11600] 40000 Ancestors of the Counts of Paris, 21-439.
2 CONT * 4.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. VII, Tafel 82; Vol. III, Tafel 722.
2 CONT * 5.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. VII, Tafel 19; Vol. III, Tafel 722.
2 CONT * 6.[S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XXVII, Tafel 68.
2 CONT * 7.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. III, Tafel 722.
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2700.htm#i81130
2 CONT *____________________
