2 CONT >36  ii.   Dona Maria de Bethencourt210,57,136,209,43,41,211,55,181,136,190,136 was also known as Luisa de Bethencourt so called by Canarian genealogists.190 She was also known as Leonor de Bethencourt so called by Canarian geneal
