2 CONC aughter of Maciot and Teguise.190 She was born illegitimate circa 1417.190,55,136 She was perhaps legitimized.180 She moved to Madeira with her father, sister, and two cousins in 1448.39,43,196,212,181 She married Rui Gonçalves da
2 CONC  Câmara, son of João Gonçalves Zarco and Constança Rodrigues de Sá, at Madeira.216,39,43,41,217,214,57,212,215,218 She and Rui Gonçalves da Câmara had no children.39,219,214,209
