2 CONT Jeanne de Fiennes1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8 Last Edited	4 Apr 2020 F, #17743, d. after 12 March 1357 Father	Sir Jean de Fiennes, Chatelain de Bourbourg, Seigneur de Fiennes, Ruminghen, & Tingry2,3,4,6,9,8 b. b 1281, d. 1340 Mother	Isabelle d
2 CONC e Dampierre2,3,4,6,9,8 d. c 13 Oct 1333
2 CONT      Jeanne de Fiennes married Sir Jean de Chatillon, Comte de St. Pol, Seigneur de Bohain, Doullens, & Luceu, son of Guy III de Chatillon, Comte de St. Pol, Seigneur d'Ancre, de Doullens, & Lucheux, Grand Butler of France and Mar
2 CONC ie de Bretagne, in December 1329; They had 1 son (Guy IV, Comte de St. Pol, Seigneur de Bohain, Doullens, & Luceu) and 1 daughter (Mahaut, wife of Guy de Luxembourg, Comte de Ligny).3,4,6,7,8 Jeanne de Fiennes married Sir Jean d' 
2 CONC Estouteville, Seigneur de Torcy, son of Estout d' Estouteville, Seigneur de Torcy & d'Estoutemont and Alix de Meulan, before November 1343; This marriage is doubtful, unless she divorced her 2nd husband. There is no record of that
2 CONC  happening.10,3,6 Jeanne de Fiennes married Sir Jean II de Mortagne, Seigneur de Landas, Bouvignies, & Sainghin-en-Mélentois, son of Sir Jean I de Mortagne, Seigneur de Landas, Bouvignies, Nomain, Roupy, Coutiches, & Flines, Gover
2 CONC nor of Bethune, Baron of Flanders and Marie de Landas, before November 1343; No issue.6,8 Jeanne de Fiennes died after 12 March 1357.3,6,8 Family 1 Sir Jean de Chatillon, Comte de St. Pol, Seigneur de Bohain, Doullens, & Luceu d. 
2 CONC a 8 Jul 1340 Children	 Maude (Mahaut) de Chatillon+3,4,6,8 d. bt 27 Aug 1372 - 1378 Guy IV, Comte de St. Pol4 d. 1360 Family 2 Sir Jean II de Mortagne, Seigneur de Landas, Bouvignies, & Sainghin-en-Mélentois b. c 1315, d. 18 Sep 1
2 CONC 356 Family 3 Sir Jean d' Estouteville, Seigneur de Torcy d. 18 Sep 1356 Children	 Jeannet d' Estouteville+5 d. 1416 Jeanne d' Estouteville+5 Colart (Nicholas) d' Estouteville, Seigneur de Torcy, Captain of Cherbourg+10 b. 1352, d.
2 CONC  25 Oct 1415 Citations [S5148] Unknown author, The Ancestry of Dorothea Poyntz, by Ronny O. Bodine, p. 71. [S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 156. [S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 780. [S2] Detlev S
2 CONC chwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XXVI, Tafel 3. [S11600] 40000 Ancestors of the Counts of Paris, 21-279. [S6] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry: 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 536. [S4] Douglas Richardson, R
2 CONC oyal Ancestry, Vol. I, p. 476. [S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. V, p. 420. [S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. I, p. 474. [S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. XIII, Tafe
