2 CONT * 4.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. X, Tafel 5.
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2856.htm#i85808
2 CONT *___________
