2 CONT      William de la Ferte was heir to Margaret de la Ferte, 2nd daughter and co-heir of William de Briwere, a great feudal lord, who died in 1226.2 He was born circa 1190. He married Margaret de Briwere, daughter of Lord William de
2 CONC  Briwere and Beatrice de Valle.3
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT 	Margaret de Briwere b. 1200, d. circa 1235
2 CONT
