2 CONT [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/PARIS%20REGION%20NOBILITY.htm#GervaiseChateauneufdiedafter1202 '''from Medlands:''']
2 CONT
2 CONT HERVE de Châteauneuf (-after 1235).  "Gervasius dominus Castri-Novi" founded an anniversary at Chartres Notre-Dame, with the consent of "Margarita uxore mea et filiis meis Hugone…et Herveo", by charter dated May 1202[3248].  "Gerv
2 CONC asius de Castello-Novo et Margarita uxor mea et filii mei Hugo et Herveus" donated “medietatem terre sue parrochie Sancti-Mauricii...Notumereia” to the priory of Saint-Barthélemy-du-Vieux-Charancey by charter dated 1202[3249].  "G
2 CONC ervasius de Castro-Novo canonicus Carnotensis" donated property to Chartres Notre-Dame, with the consent of "fratribus meis Hugone domino Castri-Novi et Herveo de Castro-Novo", by charter dated Jun 1221[3250].  Seigneur de Brézoll
2 CONC es.  "Herveus de Castello Brueroliarum dominus et Aaliz eius uxor et Willelmus de Tilly et Juliana eius uxor" confirmed the donation of revenue made to Notre-Dame de la Trappe by "bone memorie Willelmus Feritatis-Ernaldi quondam d
2 CONC ominus" by charter dated Apr 1226[3251].  "Herveius de Castello Brueroliarum dominus et uxor mea Aalis domina Feritatis in Pertico" donated revenue to Notre-Dame de la Trappe, with the consent of "Jacobus miles Tilleriarum et illi
2 CONC us feodi dominus...Hugonis filii nostri", by charter dated 1235[3252].  
2 CONT
2 CONT m as her second husband, '''ALIX de la Ferté-Arnaud,''' widow of SIMON ---, daughter of GUILLAUME Seigneur de la Ferté-Arnaud et de Villepreux & his wife Constance de Courtenay (-after 1235).  "Herveus de Castello Brueroliarum dom
2 CONC inus et Aaliz eius uxor et Willelmus de Tilly et Juliana eius uxor" confirmed the donation of revenue made to Notre-Dame de la Trappe by "bone memorie Willelmus Feritatis-Ernaldi quondam dominus" by charter dated Apr 1226[3253].  
2 CONC "Herveius de Castello Brueroliarum dominus et uxor mea Aalis domina Feritatis in Pertico" donated revenue to Notre-Dame de la Trappe, with the consent of "Jacobus miles Tilleriarum et illius feodi dominus...Hugonis filii nostri", 
2 CONC by charter dated 1235[3254].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Hervé & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i)          HUGUES de Châteauneuf .  "Herveius de Castello Brueroliarum dominus et uxor mea Aalis domina Feritatis in Pertico" donated revenue to Notre-Dame de la Trappe, with the consent of "Jacobus miles Tilleriarum et illius fe
2 CONC odi dominus...Hugonis filii nostri", by charter dated 1235[3255]. 
