2 CONC ified as "Montargis, département Loiret" by the editor of the MGH edition[178].  Her birth date range, estimated from the possible dates of her marriage and births of her children, suggests that she must have been one of her paren
2 CONC ts’ older children.  Dame de Courtenay.  “Petrus dominus Curtiniaci et uxor mea Elisabeth” confirmed donations made by “antecessorum nostrorum...dominus Milo et filii eius” to Fontaine-Jean abbey by charter dated 24 Nov 1160, witn
