2 CONT Renaud de Courtenay - was born about 1100 and died in 1194 in France . He was the son of Milo de Courtenay and Ermengarde de Nevers. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Renaud married Josceline de Donjon. Josceline was born about 1113 in Corbeil,Yerre,S-o,France. She was the daughter of Frederic de Donjon. She died after 1158 . Children: (Quick Family Chart) 
2 CONT
2 CONT i.  Elizabeth de Courtenay was born about 1127, lived in Courtenay, Loiret, Or Galinois and died on 14 Sep 1205 in France . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married Prince Pierre of France. Prince Pierre was born about 1125, lived in Courtenay,Loiret,Or,Galinois. He was the son of King Louis VI "Louis the Fat" of France and Countess Alix of Savoie. He died in 1183 in Palasti
2 CONC ne . 
