2 CONT Pierre de Courtenay was born circa 1126. He was the son of Louis VI, Roi de France and Adelaide di Savoia. He married Elizabeth de Courtenay, daughter of Renaud de Courtenay, Seigneur de Courtenay and Hedwige de Donjon, circa 1150
