2 CONT Fuentes (3) 
2 CONT 1. The Plantagenet Ancestry, by William Henry Turton {1968}  
2 CONT 2. Ancestral Roots of Certain Americian Colonists, 7th Edition, by Frederick Lewis Weis, additions by Walter Lee Shippard Jr 
