1 NOTE {geni:about_me} >'''Mabile de Beaumont (https://www.geni.com/people/Mabel-de-Redvers/6000000000953973328) ≠ Margaret de Beaumont'''. Someone had slopped-in bio information for Mabile or Mabel, which is now removed. (Ken Shelley, 2
