2 CONT When Bertha, Countess of Chester MONTFORT was born in 1155 in Chester, Cheshire, England, her father, Simon, was 38, and her mother, Amicia, was 38. She had one son and four daughters with Hugh, 5th Earl of Chester Kevelioc betwee
2 CONC n 1171 and 1180. She died as a young mother on July 12, 1189, in Évreux, Eure, France, at the age of 34.
