2 CONC . P. Dutton & Co., 1905), 12, 56. 
2 CONT * 5. "Hinckley United Independent Club Crest History". Hinckley United Independent. 2009-02-22. http://www.hinckleyunitedfc.co.uk/club/crest.html. Retrieved 2009-02-22.  
2 CONT * 6. "Simon de Montfort Middle School, Evesham". http://www.simondemontfort.worcs.sch.uk/. Retrieved 2007-05-14. 
2 CONT
