2 CONT d)         SIBYLLE de Baux (-before 16 May 1361, bur Marseille, église des Franciscains).  The testament of "Dominus Jacobus de Sabaudia Princeps Achayæ filius et hæres…Domini Philippi de Sabaudia Principis Achayæ quondam" dated 1
2 CONC 6 May 1366 names "Philippum eius filium, quem suscepit a D. Sibilla de Baucio eius conjuge…"[314].  The primary source which confirms her parentage more precisely has not yet been identified.  
2 CONT
