2 CONT *'''     A contract for the marriage of Anne Pot and William de Montmorency, Baron de Montmorency, d'Ecouen, Chantilly, & Damville was signed on 17 July 1484 at Paris, France.1 Anne Pot died on 24 February 1510; Buried at Montmore
