1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  '''AGATHA du Hommet'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Richard du Hommet and Agnes de Say
2 CONT
2 CONT ===From Medlands:===
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NORMAN%20NOBILITY.htm#AgathaHommetM1GuillaumeFougeres
2 CONT
2 CONT Her first marriage and parentage are confirmed by the Chronicon Savigniacensis Monasterii which records the death "XVIII Kal Jul" in 1212 of "Gaufridus dominus Filgeriarum, filius Willelmi et Agathæ, filiæ Willelmi de Humeto"[973]
2 CONC .  The primary source which confirms that Richard was her father has not yet been identified.  Her second marriage is indicated by the charter dated Mar [1230/31] under which “Fulco Paganelli” gave security to Louis IX King of Fra
2 CONC nce on behalf of “Radulpho de Filgeriis nepoti meo” relating to “terram suam in Normannia”[974].  m firstly GUILLAUME de Fougères, son of RAOUL [II] Seigneur de Fougères & his wife Mathilde --- (-7 Jun 1187).  m secondly FULK [II]
2 CONC  Paynel[975], son of FULK [I] Paynell of Hambye & his wife Lesceline de Subligny (-after 25 Jun 1215).  
