2 CONC  de l'histoire de Normandie, i, p. 218, says, "But William was still alive in 1191 and may well have been a minor in 1140". Delisle also gives the date, 'antérieur â 1157', the death of Abbot Louis (Gallia Christiana, xi, p. 270) 
