2 CONC  1187 or 1 Jan/17 Apr 1188[1474].  Vicomte d'Evreux until 1204.  "Rogerius de Mellento" confirmed donations to Gournay Sainte-Marie made by "pie memorie progenitoribus meis comite Galeranno et Agnete", with the consent of “uxoris 
