2 CONC miles"[1476].  m (before 1190) ELISABETH Dame d'Aubergenville, daughter of --- (-24 May ----).  The primary source which confirms her origin has not yet been identified.  "Rogerius de Mellento" confirmed donations to Gournay Saint
2 CONC e-Marie made by "pie memorie progenitoribus meis comite Galeranno et Agnete", with the consent of “uxoris mee Ysabel et filiorum meorum Almarici et Willelmi”, by charter dated to [1 Jan/10 Apr] 1205 or [1 Jan/2 Apr] 1206[1477].  T
2 CONC he necrology of the monastery of Saint-Leufroy records the death "24 May" of "Isabel uxor Rogeri de Mellent"[1478]. SEIGNEURS d'AUBERGENVILLE[1479].  "Rogerius de Mellento" confirmed donations to Gournay Sainte-Marie made by "pie 
