1 OCCU Queen of England, Queen of England/Countess of Gloucester, QUEEN OF ENGLAND, Grandmother of Isabel de Warenne, Crowned Queen of England on 8 October 1200, Queen of England; daughter of Count de Angouieme, Queen Consort of England,
