2 CONT
2 CONT Paternal Grandmother:
2 CONT
2 CONT Blanche of Navarre.	Paternal Great-Grandfather:
2 CONT
2 CONT Theobald I of Navarre
2 CONT
2 CONT Paternal Great-Grandmother:
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes of Beaujeu
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother:
2 CONT
