1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Oud Maldeghem'''…Cont.
2 CONT Philip V van Maldeghem died on 14 August 1374, after being married twice: 1) to Sibilla van Borselen, wife of Pepegem (alias Pulsegem), daughter of Wulfaard, lord of Zandenburg and of Sibilla van
2 CONT Scoude; 2) with Maria van Bethune, eldest daughter of Matthijs, lord of Lokeren and Hebuterne, widow of Walter IV, lord of Hondschote….to be continued 
2 CONT ''Ryserhove, Alfons. “Oud Maldegem.” Ons Meetjesland, vol. 19, 1986, pp. 1–6.''
