1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Marie de Picquigny1,2 
2 CONT *''''''F, b. circa 1290
2 CONT *Father     Renault de Picquigny, Vidame d'Amiens1 d. 1315
2 CONT *Mother     Jeanne de Brienne1 d. a 12 Mar 1325
2 CONT *''''''     Marie de Picquigny was born circa 1290.1 She married Jacques II de Croy, Governor of Picardie, son of Jacques I de Croy, Seigneur de Croy and Marguerite d' Araines, in 1313.1,2
2 CONT *''''''Family      Jacques II de Croy, Governor of Picardie b. c 1280
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **◦Guillaume I de Croy, Seigneur de Croy+1 d. Mar 1384
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S56] Généalogie Famille de Carné.
2 CONT * 2.[S11600] 40000 Ancestors of the Counts of Paris, 22-88.
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p3911.htm#i117462
2 CONT *_______
