1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Jeanne de Bethencourt (III) (suffix added for clarification) was also known as Joana de Bettencourt. She was born after 1435. Collard passed the fief of Béthencourt to his daughter Jeanne. Jeanne de Bethencourt (I
2 CONC II) was Lady of the fief of Béthencourt, Sigy-en-Bray. She married Jean de Bethencourt (V), son of Regnault de Bethencourt (IV) and Felipa de Troyes, circa 1469 at France. She had no children. Jeanne brought to Jean (V) as her dow
2 CONC ry the fief of Béthencourt. This re-established to a certain point Jean's financial situation. She died in 1472 three years after marrying.
2 CONT
2 CONT in: Bettencourts 1200-2000 <http://web.meganet.net/bettenco/bett0007.htm#id19947> 
