1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Maud de Chatillon   
2 CONT
2 CONT Maud was born in 1339 in Ligny et Barrois, Meuse, France.  Maud's father was Jean de Chatillon and her mother was Jeanne de Fiennes.  Her maternal grandparents were Jean de Fiennes and Isabelle de Dampierre.  She was an only child
2 CONC .  She died at the age of 39 in 1378 in Saint Pol.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestor Pedigree Chart
2 CONT
2 CONT Maud's family with Guy de Luxembourg
2 CONT
2 CONT Maud and Guy were married in a religious ceremony in 1354 in Lille,Nord, France.  They had a son named Jean.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT   Jean de Luxembourg, Lord of Beauvoir
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean was born in 1370 in Beauvoir, Picardy, France.  He died at the age of 27 in 1397 in Luxembourg.
