2 CONT * 2.[S56] Généalogie Famille de Carné.
2 CONT * 3.[S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XXVII, Tafel 20.
2 CONT * 4.[S11600] 40000 Ancestors of the Counts of Paris, 20-123.
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1973.htm#i59279
2 CONT *_______________
