2 CONT From Medlands:
2 CONT
2 CONT m '''ISABELLE''' de Condé, daughter of NICOLAS Seigneur de Condé et de Bailleul & his wife Elisabeth de Morialmes.  Enguerrand [II] & his wife had four children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NORTHERN%20FRANCE.htm#GuillaumeFiennesdied1213
2 CONT
2 CONT Pattou, Etienne. “Seigneurs De Fiennes &amp; Du Bois.” Racines et Histoire. Racines et Histoire, April 10, 2021. http://racineshistoire.free.fr/LGN/PDF/Fiennes.pdf. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Brun, Louis. “Family Tree of Isabelle De Condé.” Geneanet, May 19, 2021. https://gw.geneanet.org/zardoz?lang=en&amp;iz=1542&amp;p=isabelle&amp;n=de%2Bconde.  .
