2 CONT Isabel DE CONDÉ
2 CONT 	Born: Abt 1214, Condé, Calvados, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT Isabel married Ingelram (Enguerrand) DE FIENNES, son of William I DE FIENNES Lord of Wendover and Agnes DE DAMMARTIN. (Ingelram (Enguerrand) DE FIENNES was born about 1210 in Tolleshunt, Essex, England and died in Sep 1265.)
2 CONT http://www.fabpedigree.com/s083/f093886.htm
2 CONT
