1 NOTE There are two different entries in the Ancestral File:
2 CONT 1. Enguerrand Ingelram De Fiennes AFN:91SD-7P and Isabel Conde as wife.
2 CONT 2. Ingelram De Fiennes AFN:1592-50F and Maud Hampden as wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Ancestral File list Maud Hampden as wife #1 and Isabel Conde as wife #2.
2 CONT
2 CONT The parents for William De Fiennes are listed as shown in 1 above on the Family Group Sheet.
2 CONT The Pedigree Chart list the parents as shown in 2 above.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Group Sheets for both 1 & 2 show that three of the children have the same names and William has the same AFN  and dates on both charts.  The other two children have different AFN's and dates.  One of the charts showing the 
2 CONC two wives show no children for Isabel Conde and all of the children shown for Maud Hampden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage dates for Maud are 1224/1241/1244.
2 CONT Marriage dates for Isabel are 1230/1244/1250.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Isabel Conde listed with Jean De Brienne & Jeanne D Chateadun may be this same isabel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Since the parents of William need further research to resolve, Isabel will be shown as alternate parents until the conflict is resolved.
1 NOTE     FGRA;UA-HADFIELD-#152599
