2 CONT Hollister, C. Warren: Henry I. Yale University Press, 2001. (Yale Monarchs series) ISBN 0300098294 
2 CONT Matthew, Donald: Britain and the Continent 1000-1300. The Impact of the Norman Conquest. Oxford 2005. ISBN 10: 0-340-74060-4 
