2 CONC e that they were related in the fourth degree of kindred and have sons” and declared “their past and future offspring legitimate”, dated 26 Apr 1287[665].  m (12 Feb 1253) LOUIS de Brienne dit d'Acre, son of JEAN de Brienne King o
