2 CONC ROY de Beaumont .  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified.   v)        CONSTANCE de Beaumont (-2 Oct 1236 or after).  “Rogerus de Tony” donated property to Flamstead Abbey, Hertfordshire, for t
