2 CONC berum maritagium", to "Constancie de Toen filie Ric vic de Bellomonte consanguinee nostre" by charter dated 22 Sep 1199[667].  The Testa de Nevill includes a writ of King John dated 1212 which records that "Constancia de Touny" he
