2 CONT ## "Constance of England" in ''Royal Ancestry'' (2013) by Douglas Richardson Vol. I. page 302.  Henry I, King of England, by a mistress, _____. Constance Of England, Illegitimate daughter. He (She) married before 1130 Roscelin De 
2 CONC Beaumont, Vicomte de Beaumont et Maine, son of Raoul de Beaumont, Vicomte de Beaumont et Maine, etc., by _____, daughter of Guy II de Laval, Count of Laval. They had three sons, Richard [Vicomte de Beaumont et Maine], Guillaume, a
2 CONC nd Raoul [Bishop of Angers]. His wife Constance, was living in 1175. Roscelin De Beaumont died in 1176.
