2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis was a great fighter, great hunter & great eater. During the wedding festivities of his son Louis to Eleanor the king was taken severely ill with dysentery, which had longed plagued him. He returned to Paris & had himself lai
2 CONC d on a bed of cinders in the form of a cross, where he died (in his hunting lodge). Also, suffered from palsy & his bleary eyes could hardly make out objects. 
2 CONT
