2 CONT
2 CONT d)         GERALDE de Monteil (-after Aug 1229).  "Bermundus dominus Ucetiæ" recognised the rights of the monastery of Valbonne, in the presence of "Guirauda uxore mea domina Ucetiæ", by charter dated 29 Dec 1222[768].  “Giraud Ad
2 CONC hémar seigneur de Montélimar” promised “à son gendre Bermond d’Uzès” to grant him “pour la dot de sa fille Géralde ses droits sur les châteaux de la Valloire (Valle Aurea) et de Cossas” by charter dated Aug 1229[769].  
2 CONT
