1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/provvaldi.htm#BertrandAvellinodied1304
2 CONT
2 CONT b)        ''' GILBERT de Baux''' (-Toulon (-[25 Jun/25 Jul] 1243).  "Hugues de Baux" confirmed various property sales, in the presence of "Barrale et de leurs fils Gilbert et Barral", by charter dated 8 Apr 1217[530].  "Hugues de 
2 CONC Baux, sa femme Barrale et leurs fils Barral et Gilbert" reached agreement with the abbot of Saint-Victor concerning the monastery by charter dated 23 Jan 1221[531].  These two charters demonstrate the difficulty of assessing which
2 CONC  of Barral and Gilbert was the older son.  The testament of "Gilbert de Baux, fils de Hugues" is dated 25 Jun 1243 and bequeathes property to "sa sœur Alasacie, Sibylle sa femme…son frère Barral"[532].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (before 27 Feb 1241) as her first husband, SIBYLLE de Marseille Dame de Toulon, daughter of GEOFFROY "Gaufridet" Vicomte de Marseille & his wife Guillelme de Blacas (-after 16 Aug 1261).  "Gilbert de Baux fils de feu Hugue
2 CONC s seigneur des Baux" sold property to the prior of Saint-Gilles by charter dated 27 Feb 1241, obliging himself to obtain the consent of "Sibile son épouse et son frère Barral"[533].  The primary source which confirms her parentage
2 CONC  has not yet been identified.  The testament of "Gilbert de Baux, fils de Hugues" is dated 25 Jun 1243 and bequeathes property to "sa sœur Alasacie, Sibylle sa femme…son frère Barral"[534].  
2 CONT She married secondly (before 1252) Boniface de Castellane. 
