2 CONT  Bermond [III] & his first wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *a)         ROBERT [I] d’Uzès (-after 28 Mar 1349).  ... ... ... 
2 CONT
2 CONT **i)          CECILE d’Uzès (-after 17 Feb 1337).  ... ...  
2 CONT
