2 CONC 43/1 Jun 1344]). 
2 CONT
2 CONT *c)         DALMACE d’Uzès (-after 19 Sep 1328).  '''m''' as his second wife, GIRAUD Adhémar [II] Seigneur de Grignan, son of GIRAUD Adhémar [I] Seigneur de Grignan & his wife --- (-[7 Sep 1340/28 Sep 1342]). 
2 CONT
2 CONT *d)         ERMENGARDE d’Uzès (-after 1306).  Père Anselme records her parentage and marriage (no source citations)[1559].  '''m''' (1303 or after) as his second wife, GUILLAUME Seigneur de Châteauneuf {Lozère] Seigneur de Luc {Lo
2 CONC zère}, son of RANDON Seigneur de Châteauneuf & his wife Marquise d’Anduze (-1305). 
2 CONT
