2 CONT Family and children
2 CONT
2 CONT He married after 1120 Amice de Montfort, daughter of Ralph, senior of Gael and Montfort. They had four children:
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Hawise de Beaumont, who married William Fitz Robert, 2nd Earl of Gloucester;
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. Robert de Beaumont, 3rd Earl of Leicester;
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. Isabel, who married with:
2 CONT
