2 CONT     (2) Waleran de Beaumont: (d. before October 13, 1204).  Earl of Warwick.
2 CONT     Married #1. Margery de Bohun, daughter of Humphrey de Bohun and his wife
2 CONT     Margaret, daughter of Miles of Gloucester and he married #2. ca. 1196, Alice de
2 CONT     Harcourt, daughter of Robert de Harcourt of Bosworth, County Leicester and his
2 CONT     wife Isabel Camville, daughter of Richard Camville.  Alice died after September
2 CONT     1212.  Waleran was with Henry II in 1187/8 and was present at the coronation of
2 CONT     King Richard I at Westminster in 1189 and carried the right hand sword at King
2 CONT     John's coronation in 1199.  He was a benefactor to hospitals and abbeys.--Adec,
