2 CONT Amice de Montfort and Richard fitz Roy de Normandie were engaged before 25 November 1120. But Amice married Robert II de Beaumont, 2nd Earl of Leicester, son of Robert I de Beaumont-le-Roger, 1st Earl of Leicester and Isabel de Ve
2 CONC rmandois, after 25 November 1120 in Brittany, France.
2 CONT
