2 CONT Amice de Gael de Beaumont (1094 - c.1168)  Birth: 1094  Norfolk, England  Death: circa 1168 (74)  Convent of Nuneaton, England  mmediate Family:  Daughter of Ralph I de Gael, 1st Earl of Norfolk and Emma Amice de Vermandois de Gae
2 CONC l
2 CONT  Wife of Robert de Beaumont, 2nd Earl of Leicester
2 CONT  Fiancée of Richard FitzRoy, The King's Son
2 CONT  Mother of Isabel (Elizabeth) de Beaumont; Robert de Beaumont, 3rd Earl of Leicester; Hawise de Beaumont, Countess of Gloucester and Margaret De Beaumont De Toeni
2 CONT  Sister of Raoul de Montfort, Seigneur de Montfort et Gaël and William Gael
