1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hawise de Beaumont is the daughter of Robert de Beaumont, 2nd Earl of Leicester and Amicia de Montfort.2 She married William FitzRobert, 2nd Earl of Gloucester, son of  Robert de Mellent de Caen, 1st Earl of Glouce
2 CONC ster and  Mabel FitzHamon, circa 1150. She died on 24 April 1197.
2 CONT
