2 CONT * [1751] Somersetshire Pleas (1923), Roll no. 1205, pp. 96-7, [41 end, Henry III Vol. 36 500 (O62)].  [Margaret Schooling] 
2 CONT * [1752] Paris Notre-Dame, Tome I, XIII, p. 428.  
2 CONT * [1753] Paris Notre-Dame, Tome I, XIII, p. 428.  
2 CONT * [1754] Paris Notre-Dame, Tome I, XIII, p. 428.  
2 CONT * [1755] Paris Notre-Dame, Tome I, XIII, p. 428.  
2 CONT * [1756] Willelmi Gemmetencis Historiæ (Du Chesne, 1619), Liber VIII, XXXVII, p. 312.  
