1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Note from Curator Pam Wilson''' (15 November 2015): Her existence as the wife of [http://www.geni.com/people/Guillaume-aka-Hugues-de-Grandmesnil/6000000001744877108 William/Hugues de Grandmesnil] and as the moth
2 CONC er of Petronille/Pernel needs more evidence. If this person was indeed Alice de Beaumont, her parentage needs more proof, since she is not listed in most sources as a daughter of [http://www.geni.com/people/Robert-de-Beaumont-comt
2 CONC e-de-Meulan-1st-Earl-of-Leicester/6000000006026602016 Robert de Beaumont, 1st Earl of Leicester] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Elisabeth-de-Vermandois-dame-de-Cr%C3%A9py/6000000005861973018 Elisabeth de Vermandois]. Therefore, I
2 CONC  have removed her as their daughter until further evidence is provided.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is a possibility that this name has been confused with an earlier Aelis de Beaumont-sur-Oise who was married to an earlier generation of Hugues de Grandmesnil.
