2 CONT Sons: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Robert d. 1217, m. Hawise Meschines of Chester. Hawise is the heiress to Lincolnshire, and their only child is their daughter Margaret de Quincy, Countess of Lincolnshire.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Roger d.1265 m1. Helen of Galloway, m2. Maud de Bohun, m3. Eleanor Ferrers. His only children were three daughters by Helen of Galloway. They are Helen/Ela/Elean m. Alan Zouche; Elizabeth/Isabella m. Alexander Comyn; and Margar
2 CONC et m. William Ferrers.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Robert d. 1257 (yes, two Robert's) m. Helen/Elen verch Llewelyn.
2 CONT
