2 CONT Saire de Quincy was 2nd Baron de Quincy of Bushby and 1st Earl of Winchester. He is believed to have been an author of the Magna Carta,which he signed in 1215. His younger brother, Robert, d. 1217, was a crusader, and m. Hawise of
2 CONC  Chester (1180-1242/3, Countess of Lincoln).Saire de Quincy "at length in a pious expedition to the Holy Land, he was at the siege of Damietta in 1219 and died in his farther journey towards Jerusalem." - T.C.Banks, "Dormant and E
2 CONC xtinct Peerage of England"(London, 1809, vol. III). "Ancestral Roots..." (Balt., 1992) 53-27 state she is "grandson of Maud de St. Liz by her 2nd husb., Saher de Quincy of Buckley and Daventry." -
2 CONT
2 CONT =<nowiki>--------------------</nowiki>=
