2 CONT
2 CONT Robert De Quincy married Hawise, daughter of Hugh Kevelioc and Bertrede de Montfort. Robert De Quincy died in 1217 at London, England.  Robert De Quincy1 d. 1217
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=22 Jan 2006
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Robert De Quincy and Hawise
2 CONT
