2 CONT
2 CONT Crusader
2 CONT
2 CONT Hawise de Kevelioc married to Robert de Quincy only had one daughter, Margaret/Margery, wife of (1) Sir John de Lacy, Earl of Lincoln, & (2) Sir Walter Marshal, Earl of Pembroke. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ~ Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, pp. 154, 192.
2 CONT
