2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information: Robert also married Elen FERCH LLYWELYN, daughter of Llywelyn 'Fawr' (he Great) AP IORWERTH and Joan PLANTAGENET, in 1220-1222. (Elen FERCH LLYWELYN was born about 1206 and died in 1253.) www.findagrave.com
