2 CONT
2 CONT Roger was Constable of Scotland and second Earl Winchester (1235, in the absence of his elder brother, Robert). He was heir of his mother at her death. His three daughters divided his estate. 
2 CONT
2 CONT References: [AR7],[CP],[MCS4],[RD500]
