2 CONT Robert de Quincy, Lord of Ware 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #107760, d. August 1257
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=29 Aug 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      Robert de Quincy, Lord of Ware was the son of Saher de Quency, 1st Earl of Winchester.1 He married Helen ap Llywelyn, daughter of Llywelyn ap Iorwerth, Prince of North Wales and Joan (?), before 5 December 1237.2 He died in A
2 CONC ugust 1257, without male issue.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Robert de Quincy, Lord of Ware gained the title of Lord of Ware.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Robert de Quincy, Lord of Ware and Helen ap Llywelyn
2 CONT
2 CONT Joan de Quincy d. 12832
2 CONT
2 CONT Hawise de Quincy+ b. c 1250, d. c 12952
