2 CONC or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume III, page 169. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT
