2 CONT
2 CONT  HAWISE ([1200/12][52]-3 Feb after 1263, bur Earl's Colne).  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.   m (after 11 Feb 1223) HUGH de Vere Earl of Oxford, son of ROBERT de Vere Earl
2 CONC  of Oxford & his wife Isabel de Bolebec ([1210]-before 23 Dec 1263, bur Earl's Colne).  
2 CONT
