2 CONT "Daughter of Saher de Quincy, 1st Earl of Winchester, and Margaret de Beaumont. Grand daughter of Sir Robert de Quincy and Orabilis of Leuchars, Robert de Beaumont and Petronilla Grandmesnil.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Hugh de Vere, 4th Earl of Oxford. They had one son and three daughters:
2 CONT * Robert de Vere, 5th Earl of Oxford
2 CONT * Isabel de Vere, wife of Sir John de Courtenay of Okehampton, Devon, and Oliver de Dinham, Lord Dinham
2 CONT * Lora de Vere, wife of Reynold d'Argentine of Melbourn, Cambridgeshire
2 CONT * Margaret de Vere, wife of Hugh de Cressy"
