1 NOTE {geni:about_me} PLEASE NOTE: Maud of Chester was ONLY married to David Earl of Huntingdon. She was NOT married to William d'Aubigny--that was her sister Mabel. She was NOT married to William de Braose--that was Maud de Clare. And 
2 CONC so on. 
