2 CONT bullet  Information about this person:
2 CONT
2 CONT • Web Reference.  The Genealogy of the Bostock and Bostwick Families gives three possible pedigress for ancestry of Warin de Bostwick. The first one is based on The Visitation of Cheshire, 1580, the second is based on the Harleyan
2 CONC  Manuscript of 1535 and the third on on Ormerod's History of Cheshire. I've started with Warin de Bostock because all three seem to agree on Warin. Also, I followed Ormerod's pedigree because I hae found him to be reliable, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Warin married Hawise of Chester, daughter of Hugh Kevelioc Earl of Chester, Vicomté d'Avranches and Bertrade de Montfort.713 (Hawise of Chester was born in 1180 in Cheshire, England 160 and died in 1241-1243 in England 160.)
2 CONT
