1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Count of Brienne (1205/06–1221), King John I of Jerusalem (1210–1225), Co-Emperor John Brienne of Latin Empire (1229-1237), Progenitor of the ''d'Acre'' and ''Beaumont'' branches of the House of Brienne.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''JEAN de Brienne, King of Jerusalem, Emperor of Constantinople  (c1170/75-27 Mar 1237)'''
2 CONT s/o ERARD [II] de Brienne & Agnès de Montbéliard
2 CONT x Tyre 1210, MARIE Queen of Jerusalem
2 CONT *ISABELLE [Yolande] of Jerusalem (1211-1228)
2 CONT xx Apr 1214 RITA [Stephanie] of Armenia
2 CONT *son (c1216-1220)
2 CONT xxx Toledo 1224  Infanta doña BERENGUELA de Castilla y León
2 CONT *MARIE de Brienne (1225-1275) 
