2 CONC  3.Title: Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom; GE Cokayne, Sutton Publishing Ltd {2000} Repository:  Media: Book Page: V:168 4.Title: Plantagenet Ancestry: A Study in Colonial and 
2 CONC Medieval Families; Douglas Richardson {2004} Page: Brienne 5 
