2 CONT Raoul VIII de Beaumont-au-Maine
2 CONT (Redirected from Raoul VIII de Beaumont) Jump to: navigation, search Raoul VIII de Beaumont-au-Maine († 1238 - 1239), is the son of Richard, Duke of Beaumont and Luce de Laigle, says the Vicomte de Sainte-Suzanne and Beaumont.
