2 CONT *''''''Alice Comyn1 
2 CONT *''''''F, #102928, b. before 1296, d. before 10 August 1349
2 CONT *Last Edited=31 Jan 2011 
2 CONT *''''''     Alice Comyn was born before 1296.1 She was the daughter of Sir Alexander Comyn and Joan Latimer.1,2 She married Henry Beaumont, 1st Earl of Buchan, son of Louis de Brienne and Agnes, Vicomtesse de Beaumont, before 14 J
2 CONC uly 1310.1 She died before 10 August 1349.1
2 CONT *''''''     As a result of her marriage, Alice Comyn was styled as Baroness Beaumont before 14 July 1310. From before 14 July 1310, her married name became de Beaumont. As a result of her marriage, Alice Comyn was styled as Counte
2 CONC ss of Buchan on 22 January 1333/34.
2 CONT *''''''Children of Alice Comyn and Henry Beaumont, 1st Earl of Buchan
