2 CONC  Emperor-Regent of Constantinople 1229-37, by his third wife Berengaria of Castile, 1st dau. of Alfonso IX, King of Leon 1188-1230, by his second wife Berengaria I, Queen of Castile 1217-46, through whom he was second cousin to Ki
2 CONC ng Edward II
