2 CONT * '''Eleanor PLANTAGENET (C. Arundel)'''
2 CONT * '''Born:''' ABT 1311/1322, Grosmont Castle, Monmouth, Norfolk, England
2 CONT * '''Died:''' 11 Jan 1372, Arundel, Sussex, England
2 CONT * '''Buried:''' Lewes, Sussex, England
2 CONT * '''Father:''' Henry PLANTAGENET (3º E. Lancaster)
2 CONT * '''Mother:''' Maud CHAWORTH
2 CONT * '''Married 1:''' John De BEAUMONT (2º B. Beaumont) (b. 1317 - d. 10 May 1342) BEF Jun 1337
2 CONT ** '''Child''': Henry BEAUMONT (3º B. Beaumont) (b. 1340 - d. 17 Jun 1369) (m. Margaret De Vere, B. Beaumont)
2 CONT * '''Married 2:''' Richard "Copped Hat" FITZALAN (5° E. Arundel) 5 Feb 1344/1345, Ditton Church, Stoke Pogis, Buckinghamshire. '''Children:'''
2 CONT * '''Children:'''
2 CONT ** 2. Richard FITZALAN (6º E. Arundel)
2 CONT ** 3. John FITZALAN (1° B. Maltravers)
2 CONT ** 4. Thomas FITZALAN (Archbishop of Canterbury)
2 CONT ** 5. Joan FITZALAN
2 CONT ** 6. Alice FITZALAN
2 CONT ** 7. Mary FITZALAN
2 CONT ** 8. Eleanor FITZALAN
