2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT MARGUERITE Chabot (-1333).  The marriage contract between "Hervé de Leon sire de Noion…Hervé de Leon nostre fiuz esné e principal hayr" and "Girart Chabot syre de Rays e de Marchecoul, chevalers…damaysele Margot fille aud. Girart"
2 CONC  is dated 19 Jun 1324[451].  The date of this document indicates that Marguerite must have been the daughter of Gérard [III].  m (contract 19 Jun 1324) as his first wife, '''HERVE [VII] de Léon Seigneur de Noyans-sur-Andelle, son 
2 CONC of HERVE [VI] de Léon Seigneur de Noyon-sur-Andelle & his wife Jeanne de Montmorency (-before 20 May 1349).''' 
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/poitwest.htm#JeanneChabotMFoulquesLaval
