1 NAME Philippe /de La Rochefoucaud/
2 GIVN Philippe
2 SURN de La Rochefoucaud
1 SEX F
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT From "The Mortimer Family of Wigmore: An outline lineage" by Ian Mortimer, Version 3.0, 16 June 2016 < [https://www.mortimer.co.uk/family/outlinelineage.pdf PDF] > Page 46.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Philippe de Mortemer (d. after 1455), seigneur of Couhé, who had at least one son by an unknown wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean de Mortemer, seigneur of Couhé, who married first Philippe de la Rochfoucauld, dame de Roissac, and secondly Rosine de Pêrusse, by whom he had at least two children.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. Guy de Mortimer (d. 1512), seigneur d’Ozillac et Roissac. See below. 
2 CONT * 2. Anne de Mortemer, dame de Couhé, who married Guichard de Saint-Georges, seigneur of Vérac, and had Couhé as part of her marriage settlement.  
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT # "The Mortimer Family of Wigmore: An outline lineage" by Ian Mortimer, Version 3.0, 16 June 2016 < [https://www.mortimer.co.uk/family/outlinelineage.pdf PDF] > Page 46.
2 CONT # Watson, G.W. "Geoffrey de Mortemer and his Descendants", in Selby, Walford D. (ed. v. 1-5); Keith W. (ed. v. 6-10) Murray; and H.W. Forsyth (ed. v. 11-38) Harwood. The Genealogist (New Series). (London: George Bell & Sons) p. 1-
2 CONC 16. < [https://archive.org/details/genealogis_22selb/page/n32/mode/1up?view=theater Archive.Org] >
2 CONT # https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Jean_de_Mortemer_%282%29
2 CONT # https://www.genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00715174&tree=LEO cites
2 CONT ##  Schwennicke, Detlev (Ed.), ~Europäische Stammtafeln, J.A. Stargardt Verlag, Marburg.14:49
2 CONT # https://www.genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00702959&tree=LEO cites
2 CONT ## Martin, Georges, ~Histoire et Genealogie de la Maison de La Rochefoucauld, La Ricamerie, 1975. 172
2 CONT #https://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00060934&tree=LEO
