1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''from http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SWABIAN%20NOBILITY.htm#BernhardThiersteindied1437   v4.2 Updated 27 December 2018
2 CONT
2 CONT BERNHARD (-13 Dec 1437).  Pfalzgraf.  Herr zu Pfeffingen.  <br/>
2 CONT m firstly ITA von Toggenburg, daughter of DIETHER Graf von Toggenburg & his wife Katharina von Werdenberg-Heiligenberg (-before 20 Jun 1414).  <br/>
2 CONT m secondly (contract 1417) '''HENRIETTE de Blâmont''', daughter of HENRI [IV] Seigneur de Blâmont & his wife Valpurgis von Vinstingen (-before 1434).  The marriage contract between Henriette de Blâmont and Bernhard von Thierstein 
2 CONC is dated 1417[601].  Henriette died before 1434, when Marguerite de Lorraine Dame de Blâmont repurchased from the Graf von Thierstein the revenue from Blâmont which he received annually “à cause de Suzanne sa fille”[602].  <br/>
2 CONT Bernhard & his [first/second] wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         FRIEDRICH (-[1487]). 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         WALRAM [V] (-15 Feb 1427). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernhard & his second wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT c)         SUSANNA (-after 1468).  Marguerite de Lorraine Dame de Blâmont repurchased from the Graf von Thierstein the revenue from Blâmont which he received annually “à cause de Suzanne sa fille” by charter dated 1434[603].  m FR
2 CONC IEDRICH Schenk zu Limpurg, son of --- (-1474). 
