2 CONT  RAOUL VII né PAYNEL, sire de La Roche-Tesson (50, La Colombe), L'Epinay-Tesson (50), Grippon (50), Subligny (50) LA ROCHE-TESSON (de)Print Family Tree Born in 1220 Deceased in 1270 , age at death: 50 years old
