2 CONT Agnes du Hommet F, #601284, d. after 1244  Agnes du Hommet was the daughter of William du Hommet. She married, firstly, Baldwin Wake, son of Hugh Wake, Seigneur de Négreville  and Emma fitz Baldwin. She married, secondly, Randulph
2 CONC  de Vernay. She died after 1244. Her married name became Wake.  Child of Agnes du Hommet and Baldwin Wake  	Baldwin Wake + d. 20 Jul 1213 Citations [S37 ] BP2003 volume 3, page 4023. See link for full details for this source. Here
2 CONC inafter cited as. [S37] [S37 ] BP2003. [S37]
