2 CONT Richard De GREY (Sir Knight)
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: ABT 1195, Codnor, Derbyshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: 1250 / BEF 8 Sep 1271
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Henry De GREY (Sir)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Isolda De BARDOLPH
2 CONT
