2 CONT Conan III "Le Gros" DE BRETAGNE Duke of Brittany 
2 CONT 	Born: Abt 1091, Nantes, Loire-Atlantique, Anjou/Pays-de-la-Loire, France 
2 CONT 	Married (2): Abt 1112 
2 CONT 	Died: 17 Sep 1148 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT Conan married Princess Maud Margaret D' ANGLETERRE, daughter of Guillaume (William) I "Le Conquérant" DE NORMANDIE King of England and Matilda DE FLANDRES Queen of England. (Princess Maud Margaret D' ANGLETERRE was born in 1072.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT Conan also married Maud FITZ HENRY, daughter of Henri I 'Beauclerc' King of England and Unnamed English Mistresses, about 1112
