2 NOTE HENRY II "Curtmantle" Plantagenet King England, born Mar 5, 1132/33 in LeMans, France; died Jul 6, 1189 in Chinon Castle, France. He was the son of GEOFFREY V Plantagenet 10th Count of Anjou and  MATILDA Empress of England. He mar
3 CONC ried ELEANORE Princess of Aquitaine May 18, 1152 in Bordeaux Cathedral, France.
3 CONT Read more about Henry II in his profile.
