1 OCCU Sheriff of Devonshire, Younger son, heir to brother William 1199. Sheriff of Devonshire       1228-31. A witness to Henry III's confirmation of the Magna       Carta., Sherrif of Devonshire, Sheriff, Sheriff of Devon
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.martinrealm.org/genealogy/zouche.htm
