2 CONT  (-1157).  Seigneur de Montfort.  A Chronicle in the collection of manuscripts of the church of Nantes records the death in 1157 of "Guillelmus Montifortensis dominus" and the succession of "Rodulfus filius eius"[1224].  m AMICIE 
2 CONC de Porhoët, daughter of GEOFFROY Vicomte de Porhoët & his wife Hadvise ---.  Guillaume & his wife had two children:  
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         RAOUL (-1162).  A Chronicle in the collection of manuscripts of the church of Nantes records the death in 1157 of "Guillelmus Montifortensis dominus" and the succession of "Rodulfus filius eius"[1225].  Seigneur de Mont
2 CONC fort.  A Chronicle in the collection of manuscripts of the church of Nantes records the death in 1162 of "Radulfus de Montfort" and the succession of "Gaufridus frater eius"[1226].  
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         GEOFFROY .  A Chronicle in the collection of manuscripts of the church of Nantes records the death in 1162 of "Radulfus de Montfort" and the succession of "Gaufridus frater eius"[1227].  Seigneur de Montfort.  "Eudo Bri
2 CONC tannie comes" donated property to Saint-Martin de Josselin, with the consent of "fratrum meorum…Joscii vicecomitis et Alani Ceoche", witnessed by "Roaldo Dongie vicecomitis, Henrico de Arundelle, ---dio de Leon, Gaufredo de Montef
2 CONC orti", with the consent of "Alano de Rohan cognato meo", by charter dated 1164, witnessed by "…Stephanus frater meus…Guihomarus alterius filius de Leon…"[1228].  m ---.  The name of Geoffroy's wife is not known.  Geoffroy & his wi
2 CONC fe had one child:  
2 CONT
2 CONT i)          GUILLAUME [II] de Montfort .  Seigneur de Montfort.  m ---.  The name of Guillaume's wife is not known.  Guillaume [II] & his wife had one child:  
2 CONT
2 CONT (a)       MATHILDE de Montfort .  "Matill domina Montis-Fortis et de Noial" donated property to the abbey of Bon-Repos, with the consent of "domini Jocelini de Rohan mariti mei", by charter dated 1235[1229].  m JOSCELIN de Rohan, 
2 CONC son of ALAIN [III] Vicomte de Rohan & his wife Constance de Penthièvre (-after 17 Oct 1251).  
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
