1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00612020&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Alain II, seigneur de la Motte-du-Parc, was the son of Alain I, seigneur du Parc. He was a knight and captain of a hundred men-at-arms. With his wife Agnès de Coëtmen, probably daughter of Geslin, seneschal of Goëlle, a 
2 CONC younger son of Henri I, comte de Tréguier et de Guincamp, and Mathilde de Vendôme, he had two sons, Henri and Alain, and a daughter Aliette. All three married, and Henri and Alain are recorded with progeny. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1270 Alain and his brother Robert witnessed 'as relations' the estate division between Alain de Rohan and his younger siblings. In 1271 he received a third of the tithes of Ariovée in the parish of Gouray.
