2 CONT The Life Summary of Raoul III
2 CONT When Raoul III de Fougères was born about 1205, in Fougères, Ille-et-Vilaine, Brittany, France, his father, Geoffroy De Fougères I, was 45 and his mother, Mahaut de Porhoët, was 30. He married Yolande De Bretagne Of Brittany And D
2 CONC umonia in 1240, in Fougères, Ille-et-Vilaine, Brittany, France. He died on 24 February 1257, in his hometown, at the age of 52.
2 CONT
