2 CONC is I have some reason to doubt, in regard that a Writer of credit [Orderic Vitalis], contemporary with him, affirms; that he was of mean parentage, and raised from the dust through the favour of that King; by whose bounty he had l
2 CONC arge Possessions, and was afterwards advanced to that great Office of Justice of England."
