2 CONT ADELINE de Beaumont .  Guillaume de Jumièges names "Adeline fille de Robert comte de Meulan" as wife of "Hugues le quatrième"[2263].  Orderic Vitalis names her as one of the three sisters of Waleran Comte de Meulan, whom he marrie
2 CONC d to Hugues de Montfort[2264].  "Hugo de Monteforti filius Gisleberti de Gant" donated property with the consent of "…Haelina uxore mea et filiis meis Roberto et Valeranno" to Saint-Ymer-en-Auge by charter dated to [1145 or 1147],
2 CONC  which also refers to donations by "Hugonis avi mei"[2265].  Arnoul Bishop of Lisieux declared the donation of the church of Saint-Ymer to the abbey of Bec by undated charter which names "Hugo de Monteforti et Robertus filius eius
2 CONC  et Adelina uxor eius"[2266].  m ([1120]) HUGUES [IV] Seigneur de Montfort-sur-Risle, son of GILBERT van Gent & his wife Alice de Montfort-sur-Risle.  
2 CONT
2 CONT www.celtic-casimer.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Adeline DE BEAUMONT-LE-ROGER Comtesse de Montfort 
2 CONT 	Born: Abt 1092, Leicester, Leicestershire, England
2 CONT Events:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Alternate Birth; Abt 1097. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT Adeline married Hugues III DE MONTFORT-SUR-RISLE, son of Gilbert I DE GAND Baron of Folkingham and Alice DE MONTFORT-SUR-RISLE Countess Montfort. (Hugues III DE MONTFORT-SUR-RISLE was born about 1078 in Folkingham, Lincolnshire, E
2 CONC ngland.)
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT Adeline also married Richard DE GREINVILLE. (Richard DE GREINVILLE was born in 1119.)
