2 CONC omte de Vendôme, son of JEAN de Montoire Comte de Vendôme & his wife Aiglantine --- (-in Egypt 25 Mar 1249).  iii)        MARGUERITE de Mayenne (-15 Jan before 1264).  "Juhellus Meduane et Dinanni dominus" donated property to Vieu
