1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Machteld van Brabant
2 CONT
2 CONT Uit Wikipedia, de vrije encyclopedie
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Machteld_van_Brabant Machteld in Wikipedia NL]
2 CONT
2 CONT Machteld van Brabant (±1200 - 1267), de dochter van hertog Hendrik I van Brabant, was getrouwd met graaf Floris IV. Toen was zij al weduwe van Hendrik (VI) van Brunswijk, de Welfische Paltsgraaf van de Rijnpalts in de periode 1212
2 CONC -1214. Na de dood van Floris IV was zij voogdes en regentes voor haar zoon Willem II.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Allied ancestry of the Van Culemborg family
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Floris IV, Count of Holland
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT FHe married before 6 December 1214 with Matilde of Brabant, daughter of Duke Henry I of Brabant and Maud of Boulogne and Alsace. They children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT William II, Count of Holland (1227–1256).
2 CONT
2 CONT Floris (ca. 1228 - 1258), Regent of Holland in 1256-1258.
2 CONT
2 CONT Adelaide of Holland (ca. 1230–1284), married, in Frankfurt am Main in 1246, Jean I of Avesnes, Count of Hainaut. Their descendants eventually inherited Holland. She was Regent of Holland in 1258-1263.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret (d. 1277), married ca. 1249 to Count Hermann I of Henneberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mechtild
