2 CONT
2 CONT at Kreuzburg March 10, 1241 Heinrich Raspe Landgrave of Thuringia;
2 CONT
2 CONT in Leuven November 1247 to William III of Dampierre, Count of Flanders (1224 – June 6, 1251).
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie (c. 1226 – January 18, 1256, Donauwörth), married Louis II, Duke of Upper Bavaria. She was beheaded by her husband on suspicion of infidelity.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret (d. March 14, 1277), Abbess of Herzogenthal.
2 CONT
2 CONT His second marriage was to Sophie of Thuringia (March 20, 1224 – May 29, 1275), daughter of Ludwig IV of Thuringia and Elisabeth of Hungary by whom he had two children:
