2 CONC na filia domini Jacobi de Avennes"[1400].  m as his first wife, EVERARD [IV] Radoul Châtelain de Tournai Seigneur de Mortagne, son of BAUDOUIN Châtelain de Tournai & his wife Hildrade de Wavrin (-[8 Jan/Jul] 1226).
