1 NOTE He reigned 1216 to 1272. He was a minor when he took the throne and didn't really start ruling until 1234. He and the Barons had much discontent between each other. He attempted to raise large sums of money from them and later agr
2 CONC eed to reforms with them, but then renounced them. Simon de Montford led a rebellion against him (the Baron Wars; see notes for his son, Edward I) which was defeated after initial success.
