2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Alice De Warren was born on 1250 to John De Warren, 7th Earl of Surrey and Alice "Le Brun" De Lusignan.  Alice married Henry Percy and had a child:  Henry Percy, 1st Baron Percy of Alnwick.  She passed away in Leconfield, East Yor
2 CONC kshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice De Warren Percy is my 25th great aunt.
