2 CONC  et filie nostre Ysabella, Aalicia et Johanna et Agnes”[996].  m firstly ADELICIA [de Nevers], daughter of --- (-after 1217).  "Gaufridus vicecomes Castriduni" confirmed the foundation of "la chapelle de la Chauvelière", with the 
