2 CONC Sablé, et de Geoffroy vicomte de Châteaudun”, by charter dated Apr 1250[1027].  Heiress of la Suze, inherited from her mother[1028].  “Jeanne comtesse de Montfort” granted a confirmation charter dated 1251[1029].  The necrology of
