2 CONC  VII de Bourbon, Sire de Bourbon. He was succeeded by his son, Archambaud IX of Bourbon. His daughter Marie married John I of Dreux, another daughter, Margaret married Theobald I of Navarre and was mother of Theobald II and Henry 
2 CONC I.
