1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Isabelle was the daughter of Jean I, vicomte de Melun and Isabelle, dame d'Antoing, d'Épinoy, de Sottegem, châtelaine de Gand.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John d'Artois, Count d'Eu on July 11, 1352. They were the parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Jeanne (1353–1420), married at the Château d'Eu on 12 July 1365 Simon de Thouars (d. 1365), Count de Dreux
2 CONT * John d'Artois (1355–1363), Lord de Peronne
2 CONT * Robert IV d'Artois, Count d'Eu (1356–1387)
2 CONT * Philip d'Artois, Count d'Eu (1357–1397)
2 CONT * Charles (1359 – 15 April 1368)
2 CONT * Isabeau (1361 – 26 June 1379)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
