0 @N6000000000337436703@ NOTE Source #1:  Marcellus Donald Alexander R. von Redlich, "Pedigrees of Some of the Emperor Charlemagne's Descendants" (Baltimore:  Genealogical Publishing Co, Inc, 1988 reprint of 1941 edition), pp. 133-134
