1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT John III Duke of Brittany
1 CONT disputed with Joanna and Charles
1 CONT 1341–1345
1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT John III of Dreux Earl of Richmond
1 CONT 1341-1342 Succeeded by
1 CONT John of Gaunt
