1 CONT
1 CONT Married, 1stly, in Bordeaux, 22/25 July 1137, [AD ancestor] Eleanor of Aquitaine;  divorced 1152.
1 CONT
1 CONT Married, 2ndly, in Orleans, 1153-54, Constance of Castile, who died 4 October 1160, buried, St. Denis.  She was the daughter of  [AD ancestor] Alfonso (VII), King of Castile and Leon.
