0 @N6000000005076750251@ NOTE Henry de Beauvais , Bishop of Rouen was born circa 1121. He was the son of Louis VI, Roi de France and Adelaide di Savoia. He died in 1175.1
1 CONT      Henry de Beauvais , Bishop of Rouen held the office of Bishop of Rouen.
1 CONT Citations
1 CONT [S16] Jirí Louda and Michael MacLagan, Lines of Succession: Heraldry of the Royal Families of Europe, 2nd edition (London, U.K.: Little, Brown and Company, 1999), table 64. Hereinafter cited as Lines of Succession.
