1 CONT Cadets 
1 CONT Direct Capetians 
1 CONT House of Burgundy 
1 CONT House of Dreux 
1 CONT House of Courtenay 
1 CONT House of Artois 
1 CONT Capetian House of Anjou 
1 CONT House of Bourbon 
1 CONT House of Valois 
1 CONT House of Évreux 
1 CONT Wolff, Robert L. (1954). "Mortgage and Redemption of an Emperor's Son: Castile and the Latin Empire of Constantinople". Speculum (29).  
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT Robert Emperor of Constantinople
1 CONT (titular after 1261)
1 CONT 1228–1273
1 CONT with John of Brienne 1229–1237 Succeeded by
1 CONT Philip 
