1 CONT PAGE 71651
1 CONT QUAY 1
1 CONT Several sources show her as daughter of Robert de Beaumont and Petronnel de
1 CONT Grentmesnil, but birth dates don't work if this is true; I have made her the
1 CONT daughter of Robert de Beaumont and Aurelia de Waer only to keep her in same
1 CONT line until I can do further research - NPH
