0 @N6000000002315764471@ NOTE created 1207 Earl of Winchester by King John, Magna Charta Surety, 1215, crusader 1219 d. Nov. 3, 1219, bef. Damietta, Egypt, bur. at Acre in the Holy Land (Desc. of Charl.) 
