0 @N6000000001783222634@ NOTE Basic Life Information
1 CONT
1 CONT Mabel of Chester was born after 1171. She was the daughter of Hugh of Kevelioc, 3rd Earl of Chester and Bertrada de Montfort. She married William d'Aubigny, 3rd Earl of Arundel, son of William d'Aubigny, 2nd Earl of Arundel and Ma
1 CONC tilda de St. Hilary du Harcouet.
1 CONT
1 CONT Her married name became d'Aubigny.
1 CONT
1 CONT Children of Mabel of Chester and William d'Aubigny, 3rd Earl of Arundel
1 CONT Maud d'Aubigny+ d. a 1210
1 CONT Cicely d'Aubigny
1 CONT Colette d'Aubigny
1 CONT William d'Aubigny, 4th Earl of Arundel b. c 1203, d. b 7 Aug 1224
1 CONT Hugh d'Aubigny, 5th Earl of Arundel b. c 1215, d. 7 May 1243
1 CONT Isabel d'Aubigny+ b. b 1221
1 CONT Nicole d'Aubigny+ b. b 1221
1 CONT
1 CONT William d'Aubigny, 3rd Earl of Arundel (before 1180 - 1 February 1221) was a son of William d'Aubigny, 2nd Earl of Arundel and Matilda St Hilary.
