1 CONT JEAN DE BRIENNE (also styled JEAN D'ACRE), in right of his 2nd wife, seigneur of Château-du-Loir ... younger son by his father's 3rd marriage.  He married (1st) MARIE DE COUCY, widow of Alexander II, King of Scotland. ... They had
1 CONC  no issue.  He married (2nd) in 1251 JEANNE DE CHÂTEAUDUN, widow of Jean de Montfort ... and eldest daughter and co-heiress of Geffroi VI ... by Clémence. ... She was born after 1219.  They had one daughter, Blanche.  She was livi
1 CONC ng in 1265.  JEAN DE BRIENNE died in 1296, and was buried at Maubuisson Abbey.
