1 CONC mandy after his father died circa 1089, and had also been given lands in the Kingdom of England after his participation in the Norman conquest of England. However, at the time of the marriage, he held no earldom in England while h
1 CONC is younger brother was already styled Henry de Beaumont, 1st Earl of Warwick.
