0 @N6000000001783482882@ NOTE Basic Life Information
1 CONT
1 CONT Isabella of Meulan was born between 1102 and 1107. She was the daughter of Robert de Meulan, 1st Earl of Leicester and Elizabeth de Vermandois. She married Gilbert de Clare, 1st Earl of Pembroke, son of Gilbert FitzRichard and Ade
1 CONC liza de Clermont. She died after 1172.
1 CONT
1 CONT As a result of her marriage, Isabella of Meulan was styled as Countess of Pembroke.
1 CONT
1 CONT Relationship and Children
1 CONT
