1 CONT Henri II, Duc de Brabant was born circa 1189.2 He was the son of Henri I de Brabant, Duc de Brabant and Matilda de Boulogne.2 He married, firstly, Marie von Hohenstaufen, daughter of Philip von Hohenstaufen, Duke of Swabia and Ire
1 CONC ne of Constantinople, on 9 February 1207.2 He married, secondly, Sophie von Thuringe, daughter of Ludwig IV Landgraf von Thuringe, after 1239. He died on 1 February 1247/48.2
1 CONT      Henri II, Duc de Brabant gained the title of Duc de Brabant in 1235.
