1 CONC feudal lord King JOHN of England who wed her at Bordeaux in August (subsequently 5 issue) HUGH formed an alliance with PHILIP II King of France against King JOHN resulting in JOHN's loss of his continental possessions. HUGH may ha
1 CONC ve married Agetha de Preuilly, but most references show he m Matilda, daughter of WULGRIM III count ANGOULEME & sister to YMER/AIMAR/AUDEMOR Ct ANGOULEME the father of Isabella Taillefeur. It has been claimed that Matilda was his 
1 CONC 2nd wife and that his issue were by a previous wife, perhaps Agetha?
0 @N6000000005076844801@ NOTE Hugues IX de Lusignan was the son of Hugues VIII de Lusignan, Sire de Lusignan and Bourgoyne de Rancon, Dame de Fontenay. He married Marie d'Angoulême, daughter of Wulgrin III d'Angoulême, Comte d'Angoulême and Ponse de Lusignan. 
1 CONC He died circa 1219.
1 CONT Child of Hugues IX de Lusignan and Marie d'Angoulême
1 CONT Hugues X de Lusignan, Comte de La Marche+ d. 1249
