1 CONT   33. ^ P. Binski, Westminster Abbey and the Plantagenets: Kingship and the Representation of Power, 1200-1400 (New Haven 1995), pp. 118-9, 176-7; M. Prestwich, Plantagenet England 1225-1360 (Oxford, 2005), p. 565.
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] Sources
1 CONT
